Package: skeltools
Type: Package
Title: Project Templates for R (with Optional Python and C++)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Pierre", "Bady", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "pierre.bady@gmail.com")
Description: Creates a standard project structure (data, archive, tmp,
    src) for R analyses, with optional layers for Python, C/C++ and a
    Quarto report.
    Templates are plain files stored in the package and can be extended
    without changing the code. Also available in RStudio through
    'File > New Project'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/badozor/skeltools
BugReports: https://github.com/badozor/skeltools/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests:
    rstudioapi,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
